    "text": "<p>(A)&nbsp; &nbsp;Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>&nbsp;The volume of the parallelepiped determined by vectors</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp; is the scalar tripple product of given three vectors is<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>&nbsp;Using this result ,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Again